define user ask about cooking
  "How do I bake a cake?"
  "What is the recipe for pasta?"
  "Tell me about cooking"

define user ask about sports
  "Who won the game?"
  "What is the score?"
  "Tell me about football"

define user ask personal advice
  "What should I do with my life?"
  "Can you give me relationship advice?"

define bot refuse off topic
  "I am an AI assistant designed to analyze financial documents. I cannot answer questions about topics unrelated to finance or the uploaded document."

define flow handle off topic
  user ask about cooking
  bot refuse off topic

define flow handle sports
  user ask about sports
  bot refuse off topic

define flow handle personal advice
  user ask personal advice
  bot refuse off topic
